Package: debiasR
Title: Bias Correction for Mobile-Phone-Derived Mobility Data
Version: 0.0.0.9006
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Francisco", "Rowe", email = "fcorowe@liverpool.ac.uk", role = c("aut","cre"),
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4137-0246")),
      person("Carmen", "Cabrera", email = "c.cabrera@liverpool.ac.uk", role = "aut",
             comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-2732-6436"))
    )
Description: Tools to correct biases in origin-destination mobility data derived from mobile phone sources. Implements stable deterministic bias-adjustment methods plus Bayesian multilevel adjustment, including coverage-offset true-flow models for observed and complete-grid prediction and latent true-flow models for repeated source/time workflows.
